<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT NATAL BY EIGHT WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT NATAL BY EIGHT WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, chasing 78 to win in their second innings, beat Natal by eight wickets on the third day of their four-day cricket match at Kingsmead on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Natal 335 and 112. Australia 370 and 81 for two.</p>
